WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.033 --> 00:00:02.508
- [Voiceover] Japan's Hashima island

00:00:02.508 --> 00:00:04.606
has a foreboding presence.

00:00:04.606 --> 00:00:06.106
You might recognize it.

00:00:06.106 --> 00:00:08.345
This completely uninhabited island

00:00:08.345 --> 00:00:11.856
played home to the villain
in James Bond's Skyfall.

00:00:11.856 --> 00:00:14.115
Once a booming coal mining operation

00:00:14.115 --> 00:00:16.169
that ended in the 1970s,

00:00:16.169 --> 00:00:17.966
access is strictly limited,

00:00:17.966 --> 00:00:21.441
but coming here is like
stepping into a time capsule.

00:00:21.441 --> 00:00:24.191
(ominous music)

